1
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:16,182
Is there anything you can do for us?

2
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:19,436
All right. Okay.

3
00:00:20,228 --> 00:00:21,688
I can go defend her.

4
00:00:21,771 --> 00:00:22,772
Jolyne Cujoh, that is.

5
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:24,733
I'll take care of this geezer!

6
00:00:27,819 --> 00:00:32,949
Southeast, 127 degrees,
30 minutes and 20 seconds.

7
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,164
This time, you will not survive.

8
00:00:40,206 --> 00:00:44,586
Face southwest, 225 degrees, 0 minutes.

9
00:00:44,669 --> 00:00:47,422
F.F., it's behind you!

10
00:00:48,798 --> 00:00:52,302
I said, your enemy is the geezer!

11
00:00:56,055 --> 00:00:59,350
His arm flew behind F.F's head!

12
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:07,734
Was that a coincidence just now?

13
00:01:07,817 --> 00:01:11,863
That prisoner's glasses flew up
and stabbed F.F.'s face!

14
00:01:11,946 --> 00:01:13,990
Unlucky direction.

15
00:01:14,491 --> 00:01:15,867
I'm starting to understand it.

16
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:17,660
He's using feng shui.

17
00:01:17,744 --> 00:01:20,080
There is a principle called feng shui
in East Asia.

18
00:01:20,163 --> 00:01:24,793
Kenzou uses that dragon-like Stand
to choose his direction of attack.

19
00:01:25,376 --> 00:01:28,046
F.F., this area is your worst luck.

20
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:30,799
Just above your left ear.

21
00:01:30,882 --> 00:01:35,386
My attack overlapped with
your orientation of death!

22
00:01:48,817 --> 00:01:51,277
F.F.!

23
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:56,616
No… this is seriously bad.

24
00:01:56,699 --> 00:01:57,867
Stop.

25
00:01:57,951 --> 00:01:59,452
You cannot save them.

26
00:01:59,536 --> 00:02:03,832
The direction of our worst luck
exists for you and me as well.

27
00:02:03,915 --> 00:02:09,337
And once it's decided,
no living being can escape it.

28
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:11,047
It was proven to us just now.

29
00:02:11,131 --> 00:02:12,674
Their next target

30
00:02:13,591 --> 00:02:14,467
will be you.

31
00:02:23,810 --> 00:02:24,936
No.

32
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:29,649
I'm not talking about their head
getting chopped in half.

33
00:02:30,525 --> 00:02:35,238
I'd rather that
their head bleed profusely.

34
00:02:36,114 --> 00:02:39,492
It's worse that
they're barely bleeding at all.

35
00:02:40,201 --> 00:02:43,621
All the damage has depleted
the water levels in their body.

36
00:02:43,705 --> 00:02:46,708
The plankton in their body
are starting to die off!

37
00:02:46,791 --> 00:02:49,961
I'm glad it's not gushing out.

38
00:02:50,545 --> 00:02:53,715
But that was the unluckiest direction,
without a doubt.

39
00:04:28,935 --> 00:04:30,478
EPISODE 18: ENTER THE F.F.

40
00:04:30,561 --> 00:04:34,190
What? Return to me, dragon!

41
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:44,534
That almost finished you off, geezer!

42
00:04:44,617 --> 00:04:45,576
Never…

43
00:04:46,327 --> 00:04:48,037
Never again!

44
00:04:48,121 --> 00:04:52,625
Never will I set my foot off of
the direction of safety!

45
00:04:55,378 --> 00:04:59,632
Shit, he escaped to a safe area.

46
00:05:00,216 --> 00:05:01,050
But…

47
00:05:01,634 --> 00:05:04,804
I'm starting
to understand the orientations,

48
00:05:04,887 --> 00:05:06,597
and ways around it!

49
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:10,476
A mirror… I need to make a mirror!

50
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:14,856
If only there was a mirror midair,
then I can reflect that dragon on it.

51
00:05:14,939 --> 00:05:19,152
I can trick Kenzou into stepping
towards a fake direction of safety.

52
00:05:19,235 --> 00:05:21,612
Then, I'd have a chance to beat him down.

53
00:05:23,197 --> 00:05:25,283
But first, I must have water.

54
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,998
I can make a mirror out of water.

55
00:05:32,081 --> 00:05:35,126
I need water to heal
from all the damage too,

56
00:05:35,209 --> 00:05:39,630
but right now, I need to replenish
on water to create a mirror midair!

57
00:05:39,714 --> 00:05:43,843
In the past, over 30,000 believers

58
00:05:43,926 --> 00:05:50,266
followed my teachings
and walked in my steps.

59
00:05:50,349 --> 00:05:54,812
But ever since I came to this prison,
my life has changed.

60
00:05:54,896 --> 00:05:56,564
I'm mocked.

61
00:05:56,647 --> 00:05:59,358
Everyone mocks me and laughs at me.

62
00:05:59,901 --> 00:06:05,740
Even a pedophile
who kidnapped children ridiculed me.

63
00:06:05,823 --> 00:06:07,450
Forty years…

64
00:06:08,242 --> 00:06:10,453
I've suffered this for 40 years!

65
00:06:10,536 --> 00:06:13,915
I was once respected!

66
00:06:13,998 --> 00:06:18,211
Forty years ago, I basked in glory!

67
00:06:18,711 --> 00:06:20,713
And those days will come again.

68
00:06:21,547 --> 00:06:25,259
The feng shui which saved me
from the ravaging fire

69
00:06:25,343 --> 00:06:27,678
has now taken form as my Stand!

70
00:06:27,762 --> 00:06:32,308
I will reign as Founder once again!

71
00:06:32,391 --> 00:06:36,312
Though I may fail to break out of here,
fervent followers will return to me!

72
00:06:37,605 --> 00:06:40,399
After I finish you off, that is!

73
00:06:40,483 --> 00:06:42,693
Now, meet your end!

74
00:06:42,777 --> 00:06:45,113
Drake's Dream!

75
00:06:45,196 --> 00:06:48,449
Reveal to me
the direction of the finishing blow!

76
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:54,956
F.F., just beyond the stairs!

77
00:06:55,039 --> 00:06:57,125
There's a fire hose!

78
00:07:06,926 --> 00:07:07,802
Hey, you.

79
00:07:07,885 --> 00:07:12,557
Don't just stand there and explain things.
Go help F.F.!

80
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:13,933
You have a Stand, don't you?

81
00:07:14,016 --> 00:07:17,019
Fight with F.F. to finish off that geezer!

82
00:07:17,603 --> 00:07:19,355
Only if F.F. dies.

83
00:07:21,065 --> 00:07:24,444
My terms do not include helping F.F.

84
00:07:24,527 --> 00:07:27,196
Our deal only extends to saving you.

85
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:31,951
Besides, F.F. themself
said they don't want any help.

86
00:07:32,618 --> 00:07:35,246
When they saw your injuries,

87
00:07:35,329 --> 00:07:40,168
F.F. directed me to protect you from
the enemies in this Disciplinary Wing.

88
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:43,045
Where is it?

89
00:07:43,129 --> 00:07:44,755
How do I make water come out?

90
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:46,757
Where is the valve?

91
00:07:51,345 --> 00:07:55,933
Don't come here.
This area contains your worst luck yet.

92
00:07:56,017 --> 00:07:57,477
Guard against it at all costs.

93
00:07:57,560 --> 00:08:01,314
Or else, you will be dealt
a decisive and fatal blow.

94
00:08:01,397 --> 00:08:03,733
You don't have time to drink water!

95
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:12,325
Of their own volition?

96
00:08:14,869 --> 00:08:17,455
F.F., what the hell are you doing?

97
00:08:17,538 --> 00:08:20,666
The attack against you has been decided!

98
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,877
What are you thinking?

99
00:08:39,227 --> 00:08:42,188
F.F. must have water above anything else.

100
00:08:42,772 --> 00:08:44,732
Even in the way of a decided attack

101
00:08:44,815 --> 00:08:46,526
or the zone of worst luck.

102
00:08:46,609 --> 00:08:50,655
They got rid of their arms on purpose
so that they could fit into that hose.

103
00:08:53,991 --> 00:08:55,785
They did it! They finally have water--

104
00:09:03,376 --> 00:09:05,211
That's your own arm.

105
00:09:05,294 --> 00:09:07,255
Here comes the assassination feng shui.

106
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:10,841
Looks like you desperately wanted water,

107
00:09:10,925 --> 00:09:14,595
but you will never be at an advantage
from now on.

108
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:18,474
My attack will only bring you
the worst luck.

109
00:09:18,558 --> 00:09:23,312
Such is the assassination feng shui,
Drake's Dream!

110
00:09:23,396 --> 00:09:26,774
That's what it means
to have your fate sealed!

111
00:09:27,775 --> 00:09:30,987
They couldn't reach water.
They didn't even touch it!

112
00:09:32,446 --> 00:09:33,823
What happens now?

113
00:09:33,906 --> 00:09:37,451
Underneath this Disciplinary Wing
is the execution room.

114
00:09:38,119 --> 00:09:41,998
The State of Florida
permits the death penalty.

115
00:09:42,081 --> 00:09:43,666
Two or three prisoners a year

116
00:09:43,749 --> 00:09:49,630
are executed on
a 2,800-volt electric chair.

117
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,608
D-damn…

118
00:10:08,691 --> 00:10:11,402
I was so close to touching the water.

119
00:10:11,485 --> 00:10:13,404
But I did bust the pipe.

120
00:10:13,487 --> 00:10:15,656
I need to reach the water
upstairs somehow.

121
00:10:16,157 --> 00:10:18,117
At this rate, I'll…

122
00:10:21,078 --> 00:10:25,249
Plankton like them
would perish in an instant.

123
00:10:25,333 --> 00:10:27,001
Shit!

124
00:10:27,084 --> 00:10:29,503
This chair, it can't be!

125
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:39,722
What? Don't tell me it's already on!

126
00:10:39,805 --> 00:10:42,767
Does that sound mean
the electricity is ready to run?

127
00:10:42,850 --> 00:10:44,685
Bullshit!

128
00:10:44,769 --> 00:10:46,562
I won't let it run!

129
00:10:51,776 --> 00:10:56,656
Let's see what kind of an end
you'll meet with my attacks.

130
00:10:57,448 --> 00:11:02,578
Anyone can predict the outcome
of this situation at this point.

131
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:04,330
Before it turns on,

132
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:08,084
I will get the drops of water
dripping from the ceiling!

133
00:11:29,772 --> 00:11:34,652
Looks like your place on that chair
was already decided by fate.

134
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:37,196
Take this!

135
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:44,453
Behold, you will never obtain water.

136
00:11:44,537 --> 00:11:46,831
And that was right on time.

137
00:11:46,914 --> 00:11:49,792
You will now meet your end!

138
00:12:03,222 --> 00:12:04,932
STAND NAME: F.F.
STAND MASTER: F.F.

139
00:12:10,896 --> 00:12:11,772
F.F.!

140
00:12:12,398 --> 00:12:17,236
The absolute orientation of attack
and flawless direction of defense.

141
00:12:17,319 --> 00:12:19,113
Assassination feng shui.

142
00:12:19,196 --> 00:12:24,452
It took 40 years,
but I can now say I have mastered it.

143
00:12:24,535 --> 00:12:27,580
The Founder reigns again!

144
00:12:27,663 --> 00:12:33,210
With this, I'll go down in history
as a Buddha equal to Shakyamuni!

145
00:12:35,963 --> 00:12:38,591
You know I'm supposed to stay neutral.

146
00:12:38,674 --> 00:12:42,428
I'm in no position
to tell you this, geezer.

147
00:12:42,970 --> 00:12:46,056
But F.F. finally got
the water they wanted.

148
00:12:46,557 --> 00:12:50,728
If it weren't for your kick,
they wouldn't have had any.

149
00:12:51,312 --> 00:12:55,608
You ran a little too much,
you 78-year-old man.

150
00:12:55,691 --> 00:12:59,778
You can't help but sweat when
they had you running all over the place.

151
00:12:59,862 --> 00:13:04,533
And your perspiration
became the water they needed.

152
00:13:06,076 --> 00:13:10,080
F.F. made a mirror out of your sweat.

153
00:13:10,164 --> 00:13:13,459
With enough sweat
to fill a third of a cup,

154
00:13:13,542 --> 00:13:16,212
they can form a floating mirror.

155
00:13:16,295 --> 00:13:20,090
What I'm saying is that
you're seeing my reflection.

156
00:13:20,174 --> 00:13:24,303
So you are by no means standing
in the orientation of safety.

157
00:13:26,805 --> 00:13:28,599
It's a draw.

158
00:13:28,682 --> 00:13:31,602
The only chance
at defeating assassination feng shui

159
00:13:31,685 --> 00:13:33,187
is a draw.

160
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:36,148
They have braced themself for this moment.

161
00:13:37,858 --> 00:13:40,569
That's right, take this.

162
00:13:40,653 --> 00:13:43,239
I'll share this unluckiest fate with you!

163
00:13:44,698 --> 00:13:46,909
The direction of safety…

164
00:13:52,998 --> 00:13:54,542
F.F.…

165
00:13:57,586 --> 00:13:59,171
It's over.

166
00:13:59,255 --> 00:14:00,714
On to the next.

167
00:14:00,798 --> 00:14:05,219
You wanted to look for the bone, right?
We must start thinking ahead.

168
00:14:05,803 --> 00:14:12,268
At the least, you won't fall victim
to Kenzou's assassination feng shui now.

169
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:16,230
It was indeed a formidable Stand.

170
00:14:19,650 --> 00:14:22,486
F.F.!

171
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,032
Inconceivable.

172
00:14:27,116 --> 00:14:30,202
Jolyne Cujoh, what are you doing?

173
00:14:30,286 --> 00:14:34,373
Your body has suffered
more damage than you realize!

174
00:14:34,456 --> 00:14:37,293
The colony of plankton inside F.F.'s body

175
00:14:37,376 --> 00:14:40,629
has already been wiped out
by 2,800 volts of electricity.

176
00:14:40,713 --> 00:14:42,256
You know better than anyone else!

177
00:14:44,717 --> 00:14:47,678
B-But the dragon…

178
00:14:50,222 --> 00:14:53,350
The dragon is still here!

179
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:56,729
They must have let go of him
a moment too early.

180
00:14:56,812 --> 00:14:58,939
Or it could be that plankton

181
00:14:59,023 --> 00:15:01,317
are more susceptible to electricity
than humans.

182
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:04,778
Kenzou is still alive!

183
00:15:09,909 --> 00:15:13,162
Wait! You cannot manifest
your Stand with that body!

184
00:15:13,245 --> 00:15:15,748
Has revenge driven you mad?

185
00:15:16,582 --> 00:15:19,293
I won't let him stay alive like this.

186
00:15:22,129 --> 00:15:23,213
Stone Ocean!

187
00:15:32,723 --> 00:15:34,558
You cannot hit me.

188
00:15:34,642 --> 00:15:39,355
I will finish you and reign
as the Founder once again!

189
00:15:39,438 --> 00:15:41,065
I see it now.

190
00:15:41,148 --> 00:15:44,360
So that's the direction of safety.

191
00:15:44,443 --> 00:15:45,736
So I see.

192
00:15:45,819 --> 00:15:49,907
You were after Kenzou's
direction of safety.

193
00:15:49,990 --> 00:15:52,242
Once you identified

194
00:15:52,326 --> 00:15:55,621
the direction impervious
from every attack,

195
00:15:55,704 --> 00:16:01,627
then F.F., who scattered along with
the mirror, should be safe in this spot.

196
00:16:01,710 --> 00:16:05,339
The plankton there should've been
safe from the 2,800 volts.

197
00:16:05,881 --> 00:16:09,426
You attacked him to find this exact spot.

198
00:16:15,683 --> 00:16:18,477
F.F. survived.

199
00:16:19,269 --> 00:16:20,980
Good grief.

200
00:16:22,606 --> 00:16:24,525
How could this be?

201
00:16:24,608 --> 00:16:26,026
Jolyne!

202
00:16:27,069 --> 00:16:29,029
You think you've won now, do you?

203
00:16:29,113 --> 00:16:32,700
You think you have defeated me?

204
00:16:32,783 --> 00:16:34,535
Jolyne Cujoh.

205
00:16:34,618 --> 00:16:38,706
There is no change in my plans
to defeat you.

206
00:16:38,789 --> 00:16:41,041
You haven't noticed, now have you?

207
00:16:41,125 --> 00:16:43,293
You have already…

208
00:16:43,377 --> 00:16:48,048
stepped inside
my assassination feng shui's direction!

209
00:16:48,674 --> 00:16:52,720
My thread is inside the dragon!

210
00:16:53,637 --> 00:16:55,681
The attack is absolute!

211
00:16:55,764 --> 00:16:58,142
Your worst luck has now been decided!

212
00:16:58,225 --> 00:17:04,732
It doesn't matter how I choose to attack,
because your defeat is already decided!

213
00:17:10,904 --> 00:17:13,407
I won!

214
00:17:14,158 --> 00:17:15,909
Now, kneel before me!

215
00:17:15,993 --> 00:17:21,540
The Founder's reign cannot be altered!

216
00:17:30,132 --> 00:17:32,509
What? Hey…

217
00:17:32,593 --> 00:17:36,305
I dealt a blow, didn't I, Drake's Dream?

218
00:17:36,388 --> 00:17:38,891
Assassination feng shui is absolute.

219
00:17:38,974 --> 00:17:45,397
My deadly kick should have
defeated Jolyne, isn't that right?

220
00:17:45,481 --> 00:17:48,984
Yeah, she couldn't dodge your deadly blow.

221
00:17:49,068 --> 00:17:51,361
Then how is Jolyne unscathed,

222
00:17:51,445 --> 00:17:55,115
while I'm clinging to this fence?

223
00:17:55,199 --> 00:17:56,033
What?

224
00:17:56,533 --> 00:18:00,079
Dragon, show me the direction of safety…

225
00:18:04,666 --> 00:18:08,087
Come now, dragon, why are you moving away?

226
00:18:08,170 --> 00:18:13,550
Tell me the direction of safety!
Why won't you come closer?

227
00:18:13,634 --> 00:18:17,137
I want to ask that myself.

228
00:18:17,221 --> 00:18:19,973
You are the one getting farther away.

229
00:18:20,057 --> 00:18:24,770
You let go of that railing,
and now you are falling down.

230
00:18:36,615 --> 00:18:38,325
Why are you just blabbering?

231
00:18:38,408 --> 00:18:41,161
I said, tell me the direction!

232
00:18:41,245 --> 00:18:45,290
I told you,
you are the one getting farther away.

233
00:18:45,374 --> 00:18:48,085
Geezer, look at your own legs.

234
00:18:48,168 --> 00:18:49,878
Something is really wrong with it.

235
00:18:49,962 --> 00:18:52,673
There's something off about them.

236
00:18:52,756 --> 00:18:56,844
You could have gotten attacked
when you kicked Jolyne.

237
00:18:58,387 --> 00:19:00,055
Oh, that's…

238
00:19:01,849 --> 00:19:06,562
What the hell?
That's not her thread Stand!

239
00:19:06,645 --> 00:19:11,233
What is that Stand emerging
out of Jolyne Cujoh's body?

240
00:19:11,316 --> 00:19:12,734
Diver Drive.

241
00:19:12,818 --> 00:19:15,737
I submerged it into her body.

242
00:19:15,821 --> 00:19:19,074
Though the attack on Jolyne was decided,

243
00:19:19,825 --> 00:19:23,328
it protected her precisely
at the moment of your blow.

244
00:19:25,205 --> 00:19:29,751
What the hell?

245
00:19:45,058 --> 00:19:47,227
This man who came with F.F.,

246
00:19:47,311 --> 00:19:48,562
Anastasia.

247
00:19:48,645 --> 00:19:51,648
He put his own Stand into my body

248
00:19:52,149 --> 00:19:55,360
and destroyed Kenzou's legs in an instant.

249
00:19:55,861 --> 00:19:59,323
His bones and muscles
were entirely disassembled.

250
00:19:59,907 --> 00:20:04,203
They were then rearranged
into this spring-like shape.

251
00:20:04,286 --> 00:20:06,663
It is now a suspension
made of meat and bones.

252
00:20:06,747 --> 00:20:09,082
However, Kenzou is not feeling any pain.

253
00:20:09,166 --> 00:20:10,709
But I don't feel pain either,

254
00:20:10,792 --> 00:20:14,171
thanks to that Stand that
manipulated the guards into fighting.

255
00:20:14,254 --> 00:20:15,130
But…

256
00:20:30,604 --> 00:20:33,315
Even my hips!

257
00:20:33,398 --> 00:20:36,777
I need the direction of safety, dragon!

258
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:38,946
I can't reach it!

259
00:20:39,613 --> 00:20:42,241
I'm coming your way!

260
00:20:43,784 --> 00:20:46,161
Is he really an ally?

261
00:20:46,245 --> 00:20:48,789
He's capable of dealing
such terrible damage.

262
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:50,832
Just who is this man?

263
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,378
That's it. I love that.

264
00:20:54,461 --> 00:20:56,713
Yes, I want you to gaze at me more.

265
00:20:56,797 --> 00:20:59,925
Look at me with those eyes.

266
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:10,394
The direction of safety is northeast
and your lucky color is cerulean blue.

267
00:21:10,477 --> 00:21:13,647
But you know… I think you're done for.

268
00:21:14,982 --> 00:21:19,236
You sure aged a ton in a fight
that lasted a few minutes.

269
00:21:24,950 --> 00:21:27,619
KENZOU (78 YEARS OLD)
STAND NAME: DRAKE'S DREAM

270
00:21:27,703 --> 00:21:28,620
BEYOND RECOVERY

271
00:23:10,597 --> 00:23:12,015
Are you okay, Jolyne?

272
00:23:12,891 --> 00:23:16,645
Yes… The pain is hitting me
all of a sudden.

273
00:23:16,728 --> 00:23:22,109
But I have to find the bone
and the small man who picked it up.

274
00:23:22,818 --> 00:23:24,528
Wait just a moment.

275
00:23:25,028 --> 00:23:26,822
I can fill your wounds.

276
00:23:27,823 --> 00:23:28,990
Hurry.

277
00:23:29,741 --> 00:23:31,701
I have to get it back soon.

278
00:23:33,161 --> 00:23:34,913
My father's disc.

279
00:23:47,968 --> 00:23:48,844
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
